          "Each trainer records shift should end with a dated handoff that names what moved, what stalled, and who owns the next check. The ’Maintain approved credential, null, null, and document status records for management review.’ description on the Fitness Staffing Agency services page is the standard the reviewer checks against, not a slogan.",
